{"id": "baker-places-health-debt-repayment", "title": "A $3 million property credit reduced Baker Places’ debt to Public Health", "seconds": 64.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "b5f34052dac1c236", "words": 189, "beats": [{"scene": "origins", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "Why did San Francisco take a residential care building as repayment?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.04, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Why", "did", "the", "City", "take", "a", "building?"], "sub": "Baker Places"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.36, 0.57, 1.16, 1.42, 1.52, 2.12, 2.37, 2.73, 2.87]}, {"scene": "origins", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The story starts with an audit of Baker Places’ Medi-Cal billing.", "t0": 4.04, "t1": 7.21, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Billing audit", "heading": "Who owed the repayment?", "source": "board", "rows": [{"icon": "building", "label": "Provider", "value": "Baker Places"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Billing review", "value": "Medi-Cal"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.57, 0.9, 1.05, 1.17, 1.43, 1.54, 1.86, 2.3, 2.84]}, {"scene": "origins", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "That audit put the billing repayment at 1,304,352 dollars.", "t0": 7.33, "t1": 11.02, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,304,352", "label": "Medi-Cal repayment obligation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.45, 0.63, 0.75, 1.06, 1.57, 1.68, 2.01, 2.27, 2.56, 2.87, 3.23]}, {"scene": "origins", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "Years later, Public Health advanced funds for behavioral health contracts.", "t0": 11.14, "t1": 14.94, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "Contract advances", "mark": "Contract advances"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.89, 1.27, 1.52, 1.96, 2.25, 2.4, 2.96, 3.19]}, {"scene": "origins", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The advances and the billing adjustment came from different fiscal years.", "t0": 15.06, "t1": 18.27, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Two funding periods", "heading": "When the obligations arose", "source": "board", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Billing audit", "value": "FY2015–16"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Contract advances", "value": "FY2021–23"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.65, 0.78, 0.89, 1.2, 1.72, 1.97, 2.15, 2.48, 2.84]}, {"scene": "origins", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The City authorized those initial contract payments.", "t0": 18.39, "t1": 20.88, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The City authorized the advances"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.44, 0.99, 1.2, 1.57, 2.02]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "The Board approved a repayment agreement for 7,669,814 dollars.", "t0": 21.1, "t1": 25.08, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$7,669,814", "label": "Debt in the adopted agreement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.73, 0.81, 1.29, 1.73, 1.92, 2.25, 2.59, 2.88, 3.22, 3.54]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Baker owned a residential care building on Seventh Street.", "t0": 25.2, "t1": 27.74, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "333 Seventh Street", "mark": "333 Seventh Street"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.54, 0.61, 1.18, 1.42, 1.76, 1.9, 2.23]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "The agreement valued the property credit at three million dollars.", "t0": 27.86, "t1": 30.96, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3 million", "label": "Property credit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.58, 0.94, 1.05, 1.49, 1.85, 1.96, 2.28, 2.65]}, {"scene": "repayment", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Baker’s parent guaranteed repayment. Two other properties secured the debt.", "t0": 31.08, "t1": 34.74, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Security for repayment", "heading": "The parties and guarantees", "source": "board", "rows": [{"icon": "building", "label": "Baker Places", "value": "Borrower"}, {"icon": "agency", "label": "Public Health", "value": "Creditor"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "PRC", "value": "Guarantor"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.68, 1.2, 1.96, 2.21, 2.44, 2.91, 3.28, 3.39]}, {"scene": "balance", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]", "suspicious[2]"], "text": "Baker’s audited accounts show the property proceeds applied in fiscal 2025.", "t0": 34.96, "t1": 39.27, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "Baker Places, Inc. and affiliate", "text": "Note 6, audited statements", "mark": "Note 6, audited statements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.77, 1.16, 1.39, 1.5, 1.91, 2.4, 2.81, 2.93, 3.34, 3.63]}, {"scene": "balance", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "That June, Baker still owed Public Health 4,432,143 dollars.", "t0": 39.39, "t1": 43.73, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4,432,143", "label": "Balance at June 30, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.8, 1.17, 1.47, 1.66, 2.02, 2.26, 2.54, 2.82, 3.14, 3.48, 3.88]}, {"scene": "balance", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The parent’s accounts show the same year-end balance.", "t0": 43.85, "t1": 46.22, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Two statements, one balance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.44, 0.84, 1.06, 1.18, 1.51, 1.89]}, {"scene": "balance", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The Board’s resolution runs through January 2046.", "t0": 46.34, "t1": 49.47, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "January 2046", "mark": "January 2046"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.48, 1.13, 1.36, 1.58, 2.14, 2.45]}, {"scene": "balance", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The parent’s accounts describe service offsets ending in May 2043.", "t0": 49.59, "t1": 53.41, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "parent", "kicker": "PRC", "text": "May 2043", "mark": "May 2043"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.44, 0.84, 1.29, 1.66, 2.16, 2.51, 2.64, 2.86, 3.16]}, {"scene": "balance", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "In June 2024, a separate City review found improved financial performance.", "t0": 53.53, "t1": 58.14, "shot": "r15", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "monitor", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Public Health", "text": "Monitoring letter", "mark": "Monitoring letter"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.49, 0.77, 1.66, 1.82, 2.2, 2.48, 2.83, 3.1, 3.55, 4.04]}, {"scene": "balance", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "The signed schedules and City ledger could reconcile those end dates.", "t0": 58.26, "t1": 61.55, "shot": "r16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Executed schedule", "City receivable ledger"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.9, 1.01, 1.29, 1.64, 1.86, 2.5, 2.73, 2.9]}, {"scene": "balance", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 61.67, "t1": 63.78, "shot": "r17", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"origins": "What Public Health paid", "repayment": "How the City secured the debt", "balance": "What remained owed"}, "look": "map", "hook": "question"}